      "cooked": "<p>Ah, I see. In my case, I am trying to create a type of warranty registration form for devices that a customer has bought from one of our resellers. I had been hoping to give the customer a link field for applicable Serial Nos to choose from, but for now I’ve just put in another field for them to type in the number as plain text to be reviewed by a staff member.</p>",
