      "id": 293573,
      "username": "wale",
      "name": "Wale",
      "created_at": "2021-07-22T16:53:36.201Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried the snippet below but didn’t work either:</p>\n<pre><code>frappe.web_form.after_load = () {\n\t\tfrappe.web_form.set_query(\"account\", function() {\n\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\tfilters: [\n\t\t\t\t\t[\"Account\",\"is_group\", \"=\", 0]\n\t\t\t\t]\n\t\t\t};\n\t\t});\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/archais\">@archais</a> seems to have hit the nail on the head. This means there’s no facility for regular link filtering built into Web Forms yet!</p>",
